cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these artifacts, please cite the accompanying article."
title: "When Does Weighted Ensembling Help? A Leakage-Aware Evaluation of Transformer Juries for Emotion Recognition in Social Media Text — study artifacts"
abstract: >-
  Frozen protocol, split identifiers, per-sample predictions for all runs,
  training and analysis configurations, code and hash manifests supporting the
  article. Corpus text is not redistributed; the corpus and splits are rebuilt
  from the original sources with the included build script and checked against
  the published content hashes.
